# Public by design: the anon key ships in the browser bundle of every Supabase
# SPA — safety comes entirely from RLS (see supabase/tests/). For local dev,
# copy to .env.local and point at the local stack (`supabase start` prints
# these). Deploys read them from GitHub Actions repository VARIABLES (not
# secrets), named the same.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
